   - After second tax set (80%): Final state
3. Clear log segmentation showing trigger operations
4. Final comparison showing if total exceeds 25% threshold
5. Vulnerability decision based on final tax state
6. Explicit final verdict output as required

This PoC will now clearly demonstrate whether the contract allows setting sell taxes above the 25% limit by comparing state snapshots at critical points, providing conclusive evidence of the vulnerability's existence.

